<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 30px;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px;">
    <h1 style="color: #c8973a;">Password Reset Request</h1>
    <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to reset it. This link is valid for <strong>15 minutes</strong>.</p>
    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display:inline-block; background:#c8973a; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; margin-top:16px;">
      Reset Password
    </a>
    <p style="margin-top:20px; color:#666; font-size:13px;">Or copy this link:<br/><a href="{{resetUrl}}">{{resetUrl}}</a></p>
    <p style="margin-top:30px; color:#999; font-size:12px;">If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
